<para>Computes the output :cpp:class:<computeroutput><ref refid="classONNX__LIGHT__NAMESPACE_1_1onnx__optim_1_1OptimTensor" kindref="compound">OptimTensor</ref></computeroutput> of an <computeroutput>Add</computeroutput> node and stores it in <computeroutput>ctx</computeroutput>.</para>
