</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>a</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Name of the first input value to read from <computeroutput>ctx</computeroutput>. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>b</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Name of the second input value to read from <computeroutput>ctx</computeroutput>.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<parameterlist kind="exception"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>std::invalid_argument</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>if <computeroutput>node.op_type()</computeroutput> is not <computeroutput>&quot;Add&quot;</computeroutput>, if <computeroutput>node</computeroutput> has no output, or if the two input shapes are not broadcast-compatible. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>std::out_of_range</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>if either <computeroutput>a</computeroutput> or <computeroutput>b</computeroutput> is missing from <computeroutput>ctx</computeroutput>. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
