        <detaileddescription>
<para>Computes the output :cpp:class:<computeroutput><ref refid="classONNX__LIGHT__NAMESPACE_1_1onnx__optim_1_1OptimTensor" kindref="compound">OptimTensor</ref></computeroutput> of an <computeroutput>Acosh</computeroutput> node and stores it in <computeroutput>ctx</computeroutput>.</para>
<para><computeroutput>Acosh</computeroutput> is element-wise and unary in every revision of its schema (v9, v22 — later revisions only widen the accepted dtype set), so the output dtype and shape always match those of the input.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
