<parameterdescription>
<para>The <computeroutput>Acosh</computeroutput> <computeroutput><ref refid="classONNX__LIGHT__NAMESPACE_1_1NodeProto" kindref="compound">NodeProto</ref></computeroutput> whose output should be described. <computeroutput>node.op_type()</computeroutput> must be <computeroutput>&quot;Acosh&quot;</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>node</computeroutput> must declare at least one output. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>x</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Name of the input value to read from <computeroutput>ctx</computeroutput>. Must be present in <computeroutput>ctx</computeroutput>.</para>
</parameterdescription>
